{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\"\n       xmlns:event=\"https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/event\"\n       version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"idle\">\n  <state id=\"idle\">\n    <transition event=\"order\" target=\"done\"\n                event:schema='{\"type\": \"object\", \"required\": [id]}'/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml087-event-schema-invalid-json.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml087-event-schema-invalid-json.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":64,"endLine":6,"startColumn":63,"startLine":6}}}],"message":{"markdown":"the inline schema of `<transition>` is not JSON: invalid JSON at line 1, column 33: expected value\n\n**Note:** an `event:schema` value whose first non-white-space character is `{` (or that is exactly `true` or `false`) is the schema's JSON text; any other value is a reference to a JSON file relative to the document\n\n**Help:** write the schema as UTF-8 JSON; in a double-quoted XML attribute write `\"` as `&quot;`, or quote the attribute with `'`\n\n**Spec:** RFC 8259 The JavaScript Object Notation (JSON) Data Interchange Format","text":"the inline schema of `<transition>` is not JSON: invalid JSON at line 1, column 33: expected value"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":313,"start":312},"category":"syntax"},"ruleId":"SCXML087"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"an `event:schema` value whose first non-white-space character is `{` (or that is exactly `true` or `false`) is the schema's JSON text, and a referenced schema file must hold UTF-8 JSON; the compiler embeds the parsed schema in the Machine IR, so it must parse"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: write valid JSON; in a double-quoted XML attribute write `\"` as `&quot;`, or quote the attribute with `'`.\n\nSpecification: RFC 8259 The JavaScript Object Notation (JSON) Data Interchange Format\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML087` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8259","id":"SCXML087","name":"SCXML087","properties":{"category":"syntax"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an `event:schema` is not JSON"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}